Rare UI for Jetpack Compose
===========================

This library is a native Jetpack Compose port of Rare UI, a registry of
animated React components for the web.

    Rare UI: https://www.rareui.com
    https://github.com/swamimalode07/rare-ui
    Copyright (c) 2026 Swami Malode
    Licensed under the MIT License

Every component under rareui/src/main/kotlin/io/github/dim971/rareui/components
is a port of the matching file in upstream's `components/ui` directory: the
layout, the palette, the interaction model and the animation constants are
taken from that source rather than reinvented.

Its twin is Rare UI for SwiftUI, https://github.com/dim971/rareui-ios. The two
are ports of the same original and are kept in step deliberately.
